
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Articles"
  description="Technical articles and practical research covering cybersecurity, software engineering, cloud security and automation."
>
  <section aria-labelledby="articles-heading">
    <h1 id="articles-heading">Articles & Research</h1>

    <p>
      BlueGate Labs publishes practical technical research,
      development insights and hands-on security investigations.
      Our focus is on useful knowledge supported by testing,
      experimentation and real-world engineering.
    </p>

    <h2>Research Areas</h2>

    <div class="article-grid">
      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Detection Engineering</h3>
        <p>
          Windows security monitoring, Sysmon telemetry,
          behavioural detection, MITRE ATT&CK and
          security event investigation.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Active Directory Security</h3>
        <p>
          Windows domain security, authentication,
          LLMNR poisoning, network enumeration
          and practical laboratory investigations.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Cloud Security</h3>
        <p>
          AWS security architecture, identity and access
          management, cloud configuration and
          security automation.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Network Analysis</h3>
        <p>
          Wireshark, packet analysis, TCP/IP,
          network protocols and investigation
          techniques.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
        <p>
          Application architecture, Android and
          Windows development, automation,
          testing and practical project lessons.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Security Automation</h3>
        <p>
          Reconnaissance workflows, vulnerability
          discovery, Python automation and
          security tooling.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2>Upcoming Publications</h2>

    <p>
      Our first planned technical article examines
      LLMNR poisoning with Responder, drawing on
      practical Windows 10 and Windows 11
      laboratory testing.
    </p>

    <p>
      Additional technical articles and laboratory
      reports will be published as research
      and verification are completed.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .article-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .article-grid .project-card {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .article-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
